    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57533" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιρρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, a <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sea-fish</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρίς</span>
			, prob. a species of <i>wrasse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.187
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> species of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱέραξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				515.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνος</span>
			 (
				Lacon.
			), ib.<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄδωνις</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>), ib.<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>. (<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρις</span> in senses <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>-<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>.)</div>
